+type: task
+title: "Implement RFC 6901 JSON Pointer resolution"
+status: draft
+format: 1
+---
+
+Implemented `resolvePointer(document, pointer)` in `src/index.ts` with RFC 6901 reference-token
+unescaping, object-member traversal, and strict array-index validation. Added deterministic tests for
+root, escaped tokens, nested values, malformed pointers, and failed resolution. Documented the public
+API in the README.
